  "description": "This novel depicts the process of main characters Gong Seong-Hyeon and Chung Tae-Gyeong finding true love. Raised by parents in a loveless marriage, Gong Seong-Hyeong has a pessimistic view of love and marriage and only has superficial relationships. Meanwhile, love columnist Chung Tae-Gyeong sees love as a matter of \"give and take\" and gives love advice to others, but hasn't been able to find true love for himself. After several failed attempts free at love, two men with completely different attitudes and values eventually find true love with each other while growing together and accepting one another in their lives.\n\n(Source: Pocket Comics)",
